{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "retainpdf/contracts/ask-conversations/v1",
  "title": "阅读页提问的主对话、副对话和记忆（ask conversations）",
  "description": "2026-11-26（数据库 v40）：一个全局主对话一直延续，副对话从主对话某条消息分出来、结束时结论回到主对话；每条消息记自己属于哪本书和结构化出处（任务、译文版本、页、块、选中的字），只追加；记忆分用户层和书层，带出处和状态（active / superseded / deleted），「让 AI 使用记忆」总开关（ask_settings，默认开）。主对话只能先归档再删。库是正本，agent 只负责回答。存在数据库（ask_conversations、ask_conversation_messages、ask_memories、ask_memories_fts），不同步。v39 的按书问答记录（ask-threads.v1）只读保留，不迁。生产者：backend/packages/retainpdf-library/src/ask_conversations.rs、ask_memories.rs（校验、上限、拼上下文）、ask_views.rs（请求和返回类型），database/retainpdf-db/src/db/ask_conversations.rs、ask_memories.rs（存取），backend/api/src/routes/ask_conversations.rs（处理函数）；backend/api/src/api_tests/ask_conversations.rs 钉键集合。消费者：@retainpdf/contracts/ask-conversations，阅读页的问答窗、记忆面板；自带 agent（backend/ask-agent 的 memory.py）调 context、memories。多用户模式下这批接口关闭（全局的数据没有归属）。成功响应包在 {code, message, data} 里，本契约描述 data 部分。端点的 client_name 是前端接的时候加的（2026-11-26），生成的请求函数在 frontend/packages/api/src/generated/ask-conversations.ts，有漂移检查。AcpMemoryNotice 不是接口返回，是 ACP 消息里的 _meta。详见 docs/api/16-AI/02-主对话和记忆.md。",
  "base_path": "/api/v1",
  "endpoints": [
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/ask-conversations/main",
      "client_name": "getMainAskConversation",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "AskConversationRecord",
      "rust_view": "AskConversationRecord",
      "note": "取或建当前的全局主对话：有开着的就回它，没有就建一条空的（幂等，同一时间只有一个 open 的主对话）。不收请求体。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/ask-conversations",
      "client_name": "listAskConversations",
      "transport": "json",
      "query": "ListAskConversationsQuery",
      "output": "AskConversationListView",
      "rust_view": "AskConversationListView",
      "note": "列对话：主对话在前，同类按最近改过的在前。kind、status、parent_id 筛；值不对 400。"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/ask-conversations",
      "client_name": "createAskSideConversation",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "CreateAskSideConversationInput",
      "output": "AskConversationRecord",
      "rust_view": "AskConversationRecord",
      "note": "开副对话：parent_id 必须是主对话（副对话不嵌套，400）；forked_from_message_id 要是主对话里的消息（400）；没有父对话 404；document_id 的书不在 404。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/ask-conversations/:conversation_id",
      "client_name": "getAskConversation",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "AskConversationRecord",
      "rust_view": "AskConversationRecord",
      "note": "一个对话；没有 404。"
    },
    {
      "method": "PATCH",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/ask-conversations/:conversation_id",
      "client_name": "updateAskConversation",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "PatchAskConversationInput",
      "output": "AskConversationRecord",
      "rust_view": "AskConversationRecord",
      "note": "给了的才改：title；status（主对话 open / archived，副对话另有 closed）。归档主对话以后再取主对话会建新的；重新打开一个旧主对话时已经有开着的 409 ask_main_conversation_open；主对话改成 closed 400。"
    },
    {
      "method": "DELETE",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/ask-conversations/:conversation_id",
      "client_name": "deleteAskConversation",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "AskConversationDeleteResultView",
      "rust_view": "AskConversationDeleteResultView",
      "note": "删对话：消息、它的副对话跟着删；记忆留着（出处置空）；副对话回到主对话的摘要卡片留着（side_conversation_id 置空）。开着的主对话不能删，409 ask_main_conversation_open：先归档（界面上只给「归档并开新的主对话」）；副对话不受限制。没有 404。 消息记着的 agent 会话（session_id）没有别处在用的，retainpdf-pi 的会话文件一起删。"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/ask-conversations/:conversation_id/close",
      "client_name": "closeAskConversation",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "CloseAskConversationInput",
      "output": "CloseAskConversationView",
      "rust_view": "CloseAskConversationView",
      "note": "结束副对话（status closed）。给了 summary 就记下，并在主对话末尾追加一条 side_summary 卡片（主对话不是 open 时不追加）；已经结束的再给 summary 再追加一张。主对话 400；没有 404。第二期起不给 summary 时由后端用模型生成。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/ask-conversations/:conversation_id/messages",
      "client_name": "listAskConversationMessages",
      "transport": "json",
      "query": "ListAskMessagesQuery",
      "output": "AskMessagePageView",
      "rust_view": "AskMessagePageView",
      "note": "消息分页：seq 比 before_seq 小的最后 limit 条（默认 50，1–200），按 seq 从小到大；has_more 说前面还有没有。没有这个对话 404。"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/ask-conversations/:conversation_id/messages",
      "client_name": "appendAskConversationMessages",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "AppendAskMessagesInput",
      "output": "AppendAskMessagesView",
      "rust_view": "AppendAskMessagesView",
      "note": "追加 1–10 条（一轮问答一起），只追加不覆盖；client_message_id 在这个对话里重复的不再追加、回原来那条（网络重试安全）。对话结束了或归档了 409 ask_conversation_not_open；超过 50000 条 409 ask_conversation_limit；没有 404；字段不对 400。 改后重问的问带 edited_from（指向作废的那条）。"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/ask-conversations/:conversation_id/messages/:message_id/supersede",
      "client_name": "supersedeAskConversationMessage",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "SupersedeAskMessagesView",
      "rust_view": "SupersedeAskMessagesView",
      "note": "2026-11-26 第二期，改一条已发出的问（用户定「后面的作废，从这里重问」）：这条问和它之后还没作废的消息、盖过它的压缩摘要标作废（原文留着）。不收请求体。前端再开新会话（上下文已经不带作废的）用改后的问去问，答完照常追加一轮、问那条带 edited_from。只能从 user 起 400；已经作废 409 ask_message_superseded；对话结束了或归档了 409 ask_conversation_not_open；对话或消息不在 404。"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/ask-conversations/:conversation_id/compactions",
      "client_name": "createAskCompaction",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "CreateAskCompactionInput",
      "output": "CreateAskCompactionView",
      "rust_view": "CreateAskCompactionView",
      "note": "2026-11-26 第二期：后端用 connection 这条模型把「上一份摘要 + 它之后、最近 12 条之前的消息」压成一份新摘要，替代 seq <= covers_to_seq（原始消息不删，最近 12 条原样留着）。没东西可压 409 ask_compaction_nothing；别的请求先压完了 409 ask_compaction_stale；模型出错 502 ask_summarize_failed；对话不存在 404。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/ask-conversations/:conversation_id/compactions",
      "client_name": "listAskCompactions",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "AskCompactionListView",
      "rust_view": "AskCompactionListView",
      "note": "2026-11-26 第二期：一个对话所有的压缩摘要（旧的也在），按 covers_to_seq 从小到大；前端点压缩点「看原文」时，原文照旧从消息分页取。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/ask-conversations/:conversation_id/context",
      "client_name": "getAskConversationContext",
      "transport": "json",
      "query": "AskContextQuery",
      "output": "AskContextView",
      "rust_view": "AskContextView",
      "note": "开新会话用的上下文：用户层记忆（约 3000 字）、document_id 那本书的书层记忆（约 2000 字）、最近 recent_turns 轮（默认 6，1–20，最多 16000 字，不分书）、副对话另有主对话到分叉为止的前文；memory_text 放进系统提示词，text 是整份拼好的文字（给不认结构的本机 agent）。自带 agent 用 AI 专用密钥调（by agent）。没有 404。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/ask-settings",
      "client_name": "getAskSettings",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "AskSettingsRecord",
      "rust_view": "AskSettingsRecord",
      "note": "阅读页提问的设置：现在只有「让 AI 使用记忆」总开关 memory_enabled（默认开）。自带 agent 每次调记忆工具前看一眼（by agent）。"
    },
    {
      "method": "PATCH",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/ask-settings",
      "client_name": "updateAskSettings",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "PatchAskSettingsInput",
      "output": "AskSettingsRecord",
      "rust_view": "AskSettingsRecord",
      "note": "改设置，给了的才改，回改完的。memory_enabled 关掉：上下文不带记忆，agent 记（409 ask_memory_disabled）、查都不行；已经记下的都留着，用户在记忆面板里照常看、改、删、加。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/documents/:document_id/ask-messages",
      "client_name": "listDocumentAskMessages",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "DocumentAskMessagesView",
      "rust_view": "DocumentAskMessagesView",
      "note": "这本书上问过的地方：所有对话里属于这本书、有页码的问（role user），按页再按时间，最多 2000 条（画书页上的「?」）。没有这本书 404。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/memories",
      "client_name": "listAskMemories",
      "transport": "json",
      "query": "ListAskMemoriesQuery",
      "output": "AskMemoryListView",
      "rust_view": "AskMemoryListView",
      "note": "列、查记忆：最近改过的在前；有 q 时全文检索（trigram，每个词都 ≥3 字走 FTS5、按相关度，否则 LIKE），空格隔开的词都要在。默认只要 active。自带 agent 的 search_memories 也调它（by agent）。"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/memories",
      "client_name": "createAskMemory",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "CreateAskMemoryInput",
      "output": "AskMemoryCreatedView",
      "rust_view": "AskMemoryCreatedView",
      "note": "记一条：「让 AI 使用记忆」关着时 origin agent 的 409 ask_memory_disabled（用户自己加照常）；同层同书去掉空白后一模一样的 active 记忆已经有了就回那条（created false）；replaces 的旧条标 superseded。书层要 document_id（书不在 404），用户层不能给；replaces 没有或已删 400；每层 active 的到上限（用户层 200，书层每本书 500）409 ask_memory_limit。自带 agent 的 remember 也调它（by agent，origin agent）。"
    },
    {
      "method": "PATCH",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/memories/:memory_id",
      "client_name": "updateAskMemory",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "PatchAskMemoryInput",
      "output": "AskMemoryRecord",
      "rust_view": "AskMemoryRecord",
      "note": "改字、类别（给了的才改，updated_at 换成现在）。删了的 409 ask_memory_deleted；没有 404。"
    },
    {
      "method": "DELETE",
      "path": "/api/v1/ai/memories/:memory_id",
      "client_name": "deleteAskMemory",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "AskMemoryRecord",
      "rust_view": "AskMemoryRecord",
      "note": "删（撤销）一条：标 deleted（行留着，列表默认看不到，模型看不到）；被它替代的旧条恢复成 active。再删一次原样返回。没有 404。"
    }
  ],
  "definitions": {
    "AskPane": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "source",
        "translated"
      ],
      "description": "source 原文栏 / translated 译文栏。"
    },
    "AskConversationKind": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "main",
        "side"
      ],
      "description": "main 全局主对话（同一时间只有一个 open 的）/ side 副对话（从主对话某条消息分出来，不嵌套）。"
    },
    "AskConversationStatus": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "open",
        "closed",
        "archived"
      ],
      "description": "主对话 open / archived；副对话 open / closed（结束了）/ archived。"
    },
    "AskMessageRole": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "user",
        "assistant",
        "side_summary"
      ],
      "description": "user 问 / assistant 答 / side_summary 副对话结束时回到主对话的摘要卡片（只由结束副对话写）。"
    },
    "AskMemoryScope": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "user",
        "book"
      ],
      "description": "user 关于用户（偏好、背景、回答风格，每次都带）/ book 关于某本书（读到哪、术语、结论，按书取）。"
    },
    "AskMemoryCategory": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "preference",
        "background",
        "style",
        "progress",
        "term",
        "conclusion",
        "other"
      ],
      "description": "偏好 / 背景 / 回答风格 / 进度 / 术语 / 结论 / 其他。"
    },
    "AskMemoryStatus": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "active",
        "superseded",
        "deleted"
      ],
      "description": "active 在用 / superseded 被新的一条替代（superseded_by）/ deleted 用户删了、撤销了（行留着，模型看不到）。"
    },
    "AskMemoryOrigin": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "agent",
        "user"
      ],
      "description": "agent 模型用 remember 记的 / user 用户在记忆面板里加的。"
    },
    "AskSelectionInput": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "page"
      ],
      "description": "结构化出处（请求里的）：这一问问的是哪儿。和 ACP session/prompt 的 _meta.retainpdf.selection 同一个写法。只有 page 必填；编号类字段 1–200 个字母、数字、-_.:；空串当没给。pane 不认识、page 出范围 400；几段字超长截断。",
      "properties": {
        "document_id": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "书（item_files.file_id）。"
        },
        "job_id": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "阅读页正在读的任务（merged-… 也行）。"
        },
        "translation_version": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "译文版本编号；读原文、没有版本时 null。"
        },
        "pane": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/AskPane"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "page": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 100000,
          "description": "第几页（从 1 起）。"
        },
        "item_ids": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "maxItems": 50,
          "description": "选区落在哪几块（前端按选区换算；后端不碰坐标）。空的、重复的去掉。"
        },
        "selected_text": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "选中的字；超过 4000 字截断。"
        },
        "section": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "所在章节；超过 200 字截断。"
        },
        "source_text": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "那一块的原文；超过 8000 字截断。"
        },
        "translated_text": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "那一块的译文；超过 8000 字截断。"
        },
        "prefix": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "选区前面几个字（换版本、重翻后重新定位）；超过 200 字截断。"
        },
        "suffix": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "选区后面几个字；超过 200 字截断。"
        }
      }
    },
    "AskSelectionRecord": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "page",
        "item_ids"
      ],
      "description": "结构化出处（返回里的）：整理过的，只有有值的键（document_id、job_id、translation_version、pane、selected_text、section、source_text、translated_text、prefix、suffix 没有就不出现）。",
      "properties": {
        "document_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "job_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "translation_version": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "pane": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/AskPane"
        },
        "page": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1
        },
        "item_ids": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "selected_text": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "section": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source_text": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "translated_text": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "prefix": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "suffix": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "AskConversationRecord": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "conversation_id",
        "kind",
        "parent_id",
        "forked_from_message_id",
        "status",
        "title",
        "summary",
        "document_id",
        "message_count",
        "last_seq",
        "created_at",
        "updated_at",
        "closed_at"
      ],
      "description": "一个对话（不带消息）。",
      "properties": {
        "conversation_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "conv- 开头。"
        },
        "kind": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/AskConversationKind"
        },
        "parent_id": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "副对话的主对话；主对话 null。"
        },
        "forked_from_message_id": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "副对话从主对话哪条消息分出来；没给或那条删了 null。"
        },
        "status": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/AskConversationStatus"
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "副对话的话题；主对话空串。"
        },
        "summary": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "副对话结束时的结论；没有 null。"
        },
        "document_id": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "副对话主要讲哪本书；没有或书删了 null。"
        },
        "message_count": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "last_seq": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "最后一条消息的 seq；没有消息是 0。"
        },
        "created_at": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "RFC 3339（UTC，到秒）。"
        },
        "updated_at": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "最后一次改（追加消息、改标题状态、结束）的时间。"
        },
        "closed_at": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "副对话结束的时间；没结束（或再开了）null。"
        }
      }
    },
    "AskConversationMessageRecord": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "message_id",
        "conversation_id",
        "seq",
        "role",
        "text",
        "thought",
        "usage",
        "agent_id",
        "side_conversation_id",
        "document_id",
        "job_id",
        "version_id",
